# DUSKLING: a run starts in the dusk wood. An orange dayling drifts down
# out of the clouds with a little light, walks the empty wood and falls
# into the pit at its end, whatever it does: the far side is not there.
# Then a pink duskling wakes in the dark, and the run is its.
game duskling
wait 5
expect state == 0
press A
wait 3
expect state == 2
expect room == 0
expect py < 0
expect ground == 0
waituntil ground == 1 200
expect py == 141
hold A
waituntil state == 3 600
release
expect state == 3
waituntil state == 2 300
expect room == 1
expect px == 11
# again: this time a sprint and a long jump over the pit
reload
game duskling
wait 5
press A
waituntil ground == 1 200
cheat pos 380 141
wait 2
hold A 2
wait 2
hold A 30
hold A+UP 16
hold A 20
expect px > 500
expect state == 2
waituntil state == 3 200
